WEBVTT

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:37.930
But that's...

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.070
I know those two dragons.

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:12.500
Lisa, is something wrong?

00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:15.600
You've been spacing out for a while now.

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:18.570
Yu, she's just acting like a normal girl.

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:23.110
She's been watching Mr. Kaze
and Lou this whole time.

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:29.220
This is the first time that he's
really traveled with us.

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:33.380
The storm of love between man and
woman is about to start blowing.

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:39.480
Mr. Kaze!

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:43.260
That man...

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:20.200
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:20.200
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:27.700
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:27.700
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:36.810
With our eyes on the future

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:36.810
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:42.920
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:42.920
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:52.560
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:52.560
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:02:54.440 --> 00:03:00.070
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:02:54.440 --> 00:03:00.070
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:05.780
Fly to the Neverland

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:05.780
Fly to the Neverland

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:15.280
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:15.280
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:28.160
Welcome to the night of Wonderland.

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:33.140
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:36.940
A new enemy...

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:39.810
The flow of the endless sands,

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:44.210
that is Soil, the soul of the Magun.

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:49.080
Fading memories and a past
that has been sealed away...

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:52.130
Who will be the next assassin?

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:14.210
I know this place!

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:21.110
Work, work, work...

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:26.060
Work, work work!

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:30.890
Work, work, work...

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:35.370
Work, work work!

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:39.540
Work, work, work...

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:44.270
Work, work work!

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:48.980
It looks like they're taking it apart.

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:52.980
I've also seen some of them
putting it together though.

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:58.480
It looks like they're tearing down
what the others build up.

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:02.190
They just keep making it and
tearing it down again.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:05.300
What is this place?!

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:07.270
Why are they doing this?

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:23.580
You can't find him?

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:25.020
Did you look everywhere?

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:27.710
Don't leave any stone in Wonderland unturned!

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:30.320
Yes, Your Excellency!

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:35.060
All through the skies, in the seas, over the land!

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:37.760
I mean I want you to look everywhere, because
Omega is scattered all over Wonderland.

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:41.560
But Your Excellency, Wonderland is so big that...

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:43.540
I hate excuses.

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:46.040
I am not worthy, Your Excellency.

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:48.630
I think there were a few small places
that I may have missed.

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:54.210
Pist, I'm putting you in charge of the oceans.

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:04.360
I am currently gathering and analyzing data
from all the oceans of Wonderland.

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:06.790
So in other words, you haven't
done anything yet.

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:14.890
Your Excellency, you shouldn't be
so nasty to everyone.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:18.030
Herba, I thought I told you to go out looking too.

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:24.840
I'm preparing my big item to use
in the search as we speak.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:31.620
How cruel! You're so nasty, Your Excellency.

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:34.750
None of you are allowed to come back
until Omega has been found.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:37.280
That goes for you too, Makenshi.

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:43.090
But Your Excellency, you mustn't
ask us to do the impossible.

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:51.940
When Omega was broken and scattered, his
many pieces should have turned into crystals.

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:53.060
Therefore...

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:55.010
Shut up!

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:59.080
Pardon me, Your Excellency.

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:01.610
Omega, Omega, Omega!

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:03.920
Oscha, I want you to go in search of him too!

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:14.720
Work, work, work...

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:18.770
Work, work work!

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:22.940
They're working so hard,
and they never take a break.

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:25.410
I wonder if it's all right for them
to keep going on like this?

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:29.340
When is all this going to end?

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:30.780
It's not going to end.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:32.000
Not going to end?

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:35.480
They build it up and break it down,
build it up, break it down...

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:37.740
That way, they never run out of work.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.690
If they continue working for the rest of eternity,

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:43.320
that means that they've found their
means to survive in Wonderland.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:47.720
They've chosen this path in order to stay alive.

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:53.970
Excuse me, can I ask you a question?

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:57.270
We're looking for our father and mother.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:00.110
Excuse me?

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:01.210
Hey!

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:02.200
It's a waste.

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:05.680
They've been doing this for a long time now.

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:07.340
Work is very important to them,

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:09.620
so they don't care about anything else.

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:11.810
They have no connection with their
surroundings or anything,

00:08:11.890 --> 00:08:13.580
whether anyone is here or not.

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:15.720
Something about that stinks.

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:17.430
I know what you mean,

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:19.890
but I like it here.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:21.930
Lou...

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:27.490
You know my other form.
I'm what you'd call a werewolf.

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:30.640
In my home world, everyone changed
forms and it was no big deal.

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:32.540
But when I got to Wonderland,

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:36.340
everyone would just get scared
and run away from me.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:42.570
I was so lonely, and sad.

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:48.980
But these guys here don't worry
about anybody, so...

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:55.460
So that's why you were so cautious
when we first met?

00:08:56.300 --> 00:09:00.860
But don't you think that you'd just be
lonelier if you stayed here?

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:08.040
Ever since I got to Wonderland,

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:11.500
I've been looking for someone
to travel around with me.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:14.750
For a place where I could fit in.

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:19.490
Lou...

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:22.790
Well, search no more!

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:25.380
Hey, you should come along with us!

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:27.980
It's so fun with you around, Lou!

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:29.720
Yeah, yeah, it's decided!

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:32.960
Thank you.

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:39.040
Mr. Kaze?

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:44.140
Chobi, are you saying something has changed?

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:48.080
I'm positive that the flow of
energy here has changed!

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:08.830
Did they stop tearing down?

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:10.540
Are they making something?

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:13.370
I don't believe it!

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:14.970
Why aren't they disassembling it?!

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:16.740
I've never seen this before.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:35.750
Our work! Our work is all over!

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.400
I want to work, but I can't!

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:39.760
Please give me work!

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:41.030
Give me a purpose in life!

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:42.800
I don't know what to do!

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:45.370
I don't know what to do!

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:15.260
What's that?!

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:18.360
A robot?

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:19.730
This doesn't look good!

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:22.470
It looks like it's going to attack us!

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:07.290
Hello there!

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:09.550
Not another scary guy!

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:18.890
How rude of you to attack without
first introducing yourself.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:24.530
Hey, get down here,
you upside-down creep!

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:28.340
How sad, for a girl like you
to use such language.

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:31.080
I am one of the Four Lords of Gaudium.

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:33.340
My name is Oscha.

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:35.850
It really is one of the Earl's henchmen!

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:39.520
Why are you guys always doing
stuff like this, causing trouble?!

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:45.420
For the sake of Wonderland, we are
going to bury the evil destroyer.

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:47.550
Destroyer?

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:50.060
Is he talking about Mr. Kaze?

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:52.720
That doesn't have anything
to do with us, does it?!

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:57.330
That doesn't make any sense.
What about these people?

00:12:57.440 --> 00:13:00.900
Wonderland must constantly keep changing.

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:03.530
Every day, working in the same way...

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:06.580
Every day, doing the same thing...

00:13:09.150 --> 00:13:10.550
I don't like it!

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:12.790
Where is White Cloud?

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:15.120
White Cloud?

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:20.360
My, my, you sure do like Makenshi, don't you?

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.330
I must finish my business with him.

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:25.470
How manly of you,

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:30.800
but I can tell you now that Makenshi
doesn't really care much about you.

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:36.270
It has moved.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.880
Now Mr. Kaze is upset!

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:40.310
Everyone get back!

00:13:40.410 --> 00:13:41.400
The Magun...

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:45.680
Soil is my power!

00:13:49.520 --> 00:13:51.120
So slow.

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:52.690
Launch missiles!

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.290
What is this?!

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:04.970
Good job, Lou!

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:06.930
It's all thanks to me.

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:10.070
Go now, Mr. Kaze!

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:33.330
The Magun has thawed!

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:41.340
Good luck, Mr. Kaze!

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:46.210
My puppet here, Cube-Ashura, was
built to withstand any kind of attack,

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:52.550
be it an attack using cold, heat,
lightning, or physical shock.

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:57.510
So then, I wonder what color Soil
is appropriate for this?

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:01.460
The appropriate Soil to use
against you has been decided!

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:08.700
The light that dictates the time
of eternity, Bright Silver!

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:19.370
The darkness that dictates the time
of destruction, Destroy Black!

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:28.220
The moment that dictates the time
of extinction, Steel Gray!

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:42.530
Penetrate! I summon you, Odin!

00:16:58.210 --> 00:16:59.410
Mr. Kaze!

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:05.980
Mr. Kaze!

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:13.150
He's still alive!

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:29.900
You really got him good, Chobi!

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:34.910
That upside-down creep took off
while we weren't looking.

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:37.540
For the time being, it looks like we're safe.

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:41.920
Shall we repair what has been broken?

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:44.220
Shall we tear down what has been repaired?

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:45.550
We must work.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.130
We must work.

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:48.320
Work, work!

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:14.350
They're already starting to do
the same thing again!

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:18.310
I wonder if they're going continue
working their whole lives?

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:20.050
These guys will be fine.

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:24.130
Working, for them, is proof
that they are truly alive.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:30.060
I too have found my place in life,
proof that I'm alive!

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:32.330
To be with us?

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:35.140
You're not coming with us?

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:38.670
It's Mr. Kaze, to be with Mr. Kaze!

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:42.640
Wherever Mr. Kaze is, that is where I belong.

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:45.940
The Earl is after Mr. Kaze.

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:48.280
So Mr. Kaze has gone off by himself,

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:51.220
so as not to cause any trouble for anyone else.

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:54.390
But he still shouldn't be too far away.

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:57.120
I've got to find him and help him out.

00:18:57.760 --> 00:18:59.130
See, he needs my help.

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:03.590
If I hadn't stopped those missiles, Mr. Kaze
would have totally been blown to bits.

00:19:04.440 --> 00:19:06.130
I'm so brave!

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:09.870
I must be together with him!

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:13.040
He needs me to go with him.

00:19:16.720 --> 00:19:18.780
Lou, are you really going to leave us?

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:23.380
I've had so much fun since
I met you guys. Thank you.

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:26.790
Chobi, take good care of Yu, okay?

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:30.220
Poshepocket, keep an eye on Ai, okay?

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:32.550
Lou...

00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:35.030
Even though we've just become
such good friends...

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.770
Ai... Yu...

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:43.800
I hope you guys find your
mom and dad real soon.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:44.900
Lou...

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:48.680
Let's definitely meet again,
somewhere in Wonderland.

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:51.380
Definitely!

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:54.090
See you!

00:19:57.190 --> 00:19:58.180
Lisa!

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:01.990
Mr. Kaze is all mine!

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:06.700
Bye-bye!

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:13.310
Destroyer...

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:23.620
I suppose this means you've found Omega.

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:25.880
Not quite yet.

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:30.120
What have you been doing, Oscha?

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:32.450
Please forgive me, Your Excellency.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:34.650
I was working on getting some food for Chaos.

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:35.990
And?

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:40.660
He has just grown by another level again,

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:44.100
and is doing extremely well.

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.650
I am so thirsty

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.650
Nodo ga karakara desu

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.020
It's really getting bad

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.020
Taihen nan desu

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.140
It's burning up inside of me

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.140
Kono mune ookaji desu

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.490
My heart skipped a beat

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.490
Kimi wo hitome mita

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.390
When I laid eyes on you

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.390
Shunkan bibi tto kita

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.060
It's just like torture

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.060
Goumon no you desu

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.500
I can't take it

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.500
Taekirenai desu

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.520
Ever since I fell in love with you

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.520
Kimi ni koi shite kara

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.970
My heart skips a beat whenever

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.970
Itsumo kimi to nita

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.490
I see a girl with hair like yours

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.490
Kamigata ni ha to suru

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.570
Please, God

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.570
Douka kamisama

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.880
Can you please give me wings?

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.880
Kono boku ni tsubasa kudasai yo

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.420
From now on, my thoughts of you

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.420
Kore kare kimi dake wo motto tsuyoku

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Will only shine and grow stronger

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Omotchatte kirakira

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.050
There's so much I want to tell you

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.050
Tsutaetai koto ippai

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.060
There's not enough time left in the world

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.060
Jikan ga tarinai nai ai ai

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.890
You are now the only person

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.890
Boku no hitomi ni wa mou

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.230
That my eyes can see

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.230
Kimi shika utsuranai

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.930
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.930
Kitai wa kore kara

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.140
All of these thoughts are too much for me

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.140
Nani kara nani made omoikitchatte

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.070
So I'm just going to spill my guts

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.070
Sa subete wo butsukeyou

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:57.040
Nobody knows the right answer

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:57.040
Seikai wa dare ni mo wakanai ai ai ai ai

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.850
I'm already celebrating my joy

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.850
Atama no naka de wa mou

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:02.220
On the inside

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:02.220
Shukufuku no kurakkaa

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.190
Something is going to start

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.190
Nani ka ga hajimaru

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.920
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.920
Kitai wa kore kara

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:12.030
Let's never lose sight of our dreams

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:12.030
Nozomi wo mochimashou

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.390
All right!

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.390
All right!

00:22:16.560 --> 00:22:19.230
Final Fantasy: Unlimited

00:22:23.270 --> 00:22:24.700
Here is my prophecy.

00:22:25.840 --> 00:22:27.930
It is sad when you are all alone.

00:22:28.380 --> 00:22:29.870
But it will be all right,

